       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TSCPURGE.
       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *REMARKS.                THIS PROGRAM PURGES SAFETY CONTACT RECORDS
      *                        BASED ON THE CYCLE TIME SET BY THE USER.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SAFETY-CONTACT
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLSC0103
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  SAFETY-CONTACT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  SC-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLSC0103.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  SYSTEM-SW           PIC 99    VALUE 0.
           88  SYSTEM-OFF                VALUE 0.
       77  FILE-STAT           PIC XX.

       01  TODAYS-DATE.
           05  DATE-BUF-CT     PIC XX.
           05  DATE-BUFFER.
               10  DATE-BUF-YY PIC XX.
               10  DATE-BUF-MM PIC XX.
               10  DATE-BUF-DD PIC XX.

       01  EQUIP-BUFFER.
           05  EQUIP-VALUES.
               10  EQP01       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE01".
               10  EQP02       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE02".
               10  EQP03       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE03".
               10  EQP04       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE04".
               10  EQP05       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE05".
               10  EQP06       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE06".
               10  EQP07       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE07".
               10  EQP08       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE08".
               10  EQP09       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE09".
               10  EQP10       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE10".
               10  EQP11       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE11".
               10  EQP12       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE12".
               10  EQP13       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE13".
               10  EQP14       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE14".
               10  EQP15       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE15".
               10  EQP16       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE16".
               10  EQP17       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE17".
               10  EQP18       PIC X(06) VALUE "SAFE18".
           05  EQP-VAL         REDEFINES EQUIP-VALUES.
               10  EQPVAL      OCCURS 18 TIMES  PIC X(06).

       01  DB-ERROR.
           05  DB-FUNC         PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DB-FILE         PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(20) VALUE "ERROR - FILE-STAT = ".
           05  CON-WORD        PIC XX.

           COPY SAFECONT       IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       BEGIN.
           OPEN I-O            SAFETY-CONTACT.
           ACCEPT DATE-BUFFER  FROM DATE.
           MOVE 20             TO DATE-BUF-CT.
           IF DATE-BUF-YY > 60
               MOVE 19         TO DATE-BUF-CT.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO SCDELDATE OF SAFETY-CONTACT.
           START SAFETY-CONTACT KEY NOT < SCDELDATE OF SAFETY-CONTACT
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       6-LOOP.
           READ SAFETY-CONTACT PRIOR INTO CONTACT-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           IF SC-DELETE-DATE < TODAYS-DATE
               DELETE SAFETY-CONTACT
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.

           GO TO 6-LOOP.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               SAFETY-CONTACT.
           GOBACK.

